# Multiple TreePane — Compact Two-Row Subheader & Vanilla Search Architecture (`v01-02_compact-two-row-header-and-search`)

> **Version**: `v01-02` (Subheader Compaction, A-Z Repo Show/Hide Bar, & Vanilla VS Code Find Mechanics)  
> **Baseline References**:  
> - [`brief/v01-00_main-idea.md`](file:///e:/proj/vscode-exstension_multiple-treepane/brief/v01-00_main-idea.md)  
> - [`brief/v01-01_structure-and-tecnical.md`](file:///e:/proj/vscode-exstension_multiple-treepane/brief/v01-01_structure-and-tecnical.md)  
> - [`e:/proj/all-lads-tool/skill/briefing-0x-0x-version.md`](file:///e:/proj/all-lads-tool/skill/briefing-0x-0x-version.md)  
> - [`e:/proj/all-lads-tool/skill/asci-tree-codeblock-standard.md`](file:///e:/proj/all-lads-tool/skill/asci-tree-codeblock-standard.md)  
> **Primary Objectives**:  
> 1. Main Header A-Z Repo Checkbox Filter: Dynamic discovery of all workspace Git repositories and folders, rendered alphabetically as toggleable `[x] repo-name` pills to show or hide panels with one click.  
> 2. Subheader Compaction: Reduce pane headers to strictly 2 clean rows (Row 1: Identity & Reorder Controls, Row 2: Vanilla VS Code Search Box).  
> 3. Vanilla VS Code Search Box Mechanics: Search input with integrated inline toggle buttons for Match Case (`Aa`), Match Whole Word (`ab`), and Regular Expression (`.*`).  
> 4. Error state feedback: Invalid regex input highlights the search box with an error border (`var(--vscode-inputValidation-errorBorder)`).  

