## 3. Data Models & Search State Engine

### 3.1 Updated `PaneConfig` Interface (`src/types.ts`)

```typescript
export interface SearchOptions {
  matchCase: boolean;
  matchWholeWord: boolean;
  useRegex: boolean;
}

export interface PaneConfig {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  rootPath: string;
  filterText: string;
  searchOptions: SearchOptions;
  isCollapsed: boolean;
  isHidden?: boolean;
  size?: number;
}
```

### 3.2 State Flow Architecture

```text
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                           EXTENSION HOST                               |
|  - FileSystemService.discoverWorkspaceRepos()                          |
|  - Workspace State Persistence                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                |  postMessage('init', { availableRepos, panes })
                                v
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                            WEBVIEW UI                                  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  | MAIN HEADER: [x] all-lads-tool   [x] pakcli-plugin   [ ] docs    |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                |                                       |
|  +-----------------------------+------------------------------------+  |
|  | SPLIT CONTAINER (Horizontal or Vertical)                         |  |
|  |  +--------------------------+  +-------------------------------+ |  |
|  |  | PANE #1                  |  | PANE #2                       | |  |
|  |  | Row 1: ::: #1 name [1st] ✕|  | Row 1: ::: #2 name [1st] ✕    | |  |
|  |  | Row 2: [Search Aa ab .*] |  | Row 2: [Search Aa ab .*]      | |  |
|  |  | Tree Nodes...            |  | Tree Nodes...                 | |  |
|  |  +--------------------------+  +-------------------------------+ |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

