### 4.2 Two-Row Default with Expandable 3rd Row per Split Pane

```text
Default State (Compact 2 Rows):
+----------------------------------------------------+
| ::: #1: all-lads-tool             [1st] [<] [>]  ✕ |  <- Row 1: Identity & Reorder
| [>] [ Filter files...              | Aa | ab | .* ]|  <- Row 2: Vanilla VS Code Find
+----------------------------------------------------+
| v script/                                          |
|   > file/                                          |

Expanded State (When [>] is clicked -> reveals Row 3):
+----------------------------------------------------+
| ::: #1: all-lads-tool             [1st] [<] [>]  ✕ |  <- Row 1: Identity & Reorder
| [v] [ Filter files...              | Aa | ab | .* ]|  <- Row 2: Vanilla VS Code Find
|     [ 📁 Switch Root Dropdown ▾ ]  [📁 Browse] [↻] |  <- Row 3: Advanced Root Controls
+----------------------------------------------------+
| v script/                                          |
|   > file/                                          |
```

